[00:11.18](Psalm 27:13)
[00:22.36]1. Why should I fear the lion?
[00:28.60]Why should I fear any foe?
[00:34.65]With Jehovah by my side,
[00:38.25]I will not run and hide.
[00:41.85]My God is with me; this I know.
[00:47.85](Chorus)
[00:50.12]With eyes of faith,
[00:52.38]I see beyond the darkness.
[00:54.65]With eyes of faith,
[00:58.25]there’s nothing more to fear.
[01:02.01]With Jehovah, I am strong,
[01:05.81]Determined to go on,
[01:09.61]Knowing that my God
[01:12.68]is always near—
[01:15.74]With eyes of faith.
[01:30.33]2. Those faithful ones before us
[01:37.34]Lived their lives in loyalty.
[01:43.20]By their faith they endured.
[01:46.70]Their future is assured.
[01:50.20]They’ll stand again for all to see.
[02:09.21](Chorus)
[02:28.22]With eyes of faith,
[02:32.06]I see beyond the darkness.
[02:33.06]With eyes of faith,
[02:34.06]there’s nothing more to fear.
[02:35.06]With Jehovah, I am strong,
[02:36.06]Determined to go on,
[02:37.06]Knowing that my God
[02:38.06]is always near—
[02:39.06]With eyes of faith.
[02:40.06](Bridge)
[02:42.06]With eyes of faith,
[02:42.92]I can move a mountain.
[02:43.77]With eyes of faith,
[02:44.63]my hope is sure.
[02:45.49]Where would I be
[02:46.35]Without the faith
[02:47.20]that helps me see
[02:49.06]Beyond the trials I endure?
[03:00.09]3. I see the wondrous future
[03:06.33]God has in store for me.
[03:12.81]I need to be strong.
[03:15.85]I know it won’t be long
[03:18.89]Till Jehovah claims his victory.
[03:37.71](Chorus)
[03:56.54]With eyes of faith,
[04:03.59]I see beyond the darkness.
[04:10.65]With eyes of faith,
[04:12.50]there’s nothing more to fear.
[04:14.35]With Jehovah, I am strong,
[04:16.20]Determined to go on,
[04:18.06]Knowing that my God
[04:19.91]is always near—
[04:21.76]With eyes of faith,
[04:23.61]With eyes of faith.